  "description": "Experimental Unified Diagnostic Services (ISO 14229-1) client for CanKit.Pro. Provides an async IUdsClient over IIsoTpChannel with the MVP service set (0x10 DiagnosticSessionControl, 0x11 ECUReset, 0x22 ReadDataByIdentifier, 0x27 SecurityAccess, 0x2E WriteDataByIdentifier, 0x31 RoutineControl, 0x3E TesterPresent), P2/P2* timing, NRC 0x78 responsePending handling and structured negative-response reporting.",
